<title>UK: KBG sets 80 million Swiss franc 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>KBG sets 80 million Swiss franc 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Zurcher Kantonalbank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   KERNKRAFTWERK-BEILIGUNGSGESELLSCHAFT AG</p>
<p> AMT    80 MLN SFR    COUPON     4.0	 MATURITY    15.NOV.06</p>
